[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

; zone_abyss_crypts — the Abyss Crypts (P5, 2026-10-07), band 40–42: the last dungeon, under the
; Cinderlands, after the shape of the original's catacombs (docs/11-abyss-crypts.md).
;
; Seven rooms, one footprint, stacked twenty-four metres apart, only the occupied one awake.
; Black and violet flagstones, walls of crypt stone, fires burning violet. What lives here is
; only what data cannot hold: where the player lands, where the stair is, where a target may
; stand, where a wave walks in, and the walls that make each room what it is. What each floor
; asks is in game/data/zones/crypts.json. Written by `kiln scenes` from
; src/Kiln.Tools/Commands/CryptLayout.cs: change the layout, not this file.

